      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1937934220682203154",
      "text": "[6:58PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Lekki Roundabout to Lekki Peninsula Gate, Fam City, Admiralty Roundabout, Roads 13 & 14, UBA Traffic Light, Zenith Junction, Dome/Freedom Way, and Itedo Car Wash, with traffic flowing freely.\n\nModerate traffic congestion from VFS to Ikate Gate due to traffic light automation at Ikate Roundabout.\n\nSmooth return journey from Ikate Gate to VFS, Car Wash, Dome/Freedom Way, UBA/Admiralty Road Traffic Light, and Roads 13 & 14.\n\nBusy traffic conditions on Admiralty Roundabout en route to Link Bridge due to evening rush hour.\n\nSlow traffic movement on Alexandra inward Admiralty Roundabout due to speed breakers.\n\nFree-flowing traffic from Farm City to Lekki Peninsula Gate and down to Lekki Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
