      "text": "[8:40PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic movement throughout the zone, with no reported impediments or accidents.\nAppreciable traffic flow on Lagos-Ibadan Expressway, with easy movement in and out.\nFast-moving traffic from Isheri Olowora to Omole Junction (via River Valley, VIS, and Omole Gate).\nGood movement from Wempco to Odo Eran, Caterpillar, and beyond.\n\nReturn journey from Wempco to Odo Eran and Caterpillar is good.\nWempco to Lateef Jakande, connecting Omole Junction, Omole Gate, VIS, River Valley, and Isheri Olowora is also good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
